    "description": "Season's Choice Sweet Garden Peas are as tasty as they sound, and they're easy to prepare. These frozen peas are premium Grade A quality, naturally low in fat, cholesterol free, and have no added sodium. When you're ready to enjoy these peas, just take them out the freezer and either cook them on your stove top or in the microwave. Serve with mashed potatoes, chicken, steak, and more. Discover all of our delicious and affordable frozen food options at ALDI.",
